OL,3,AProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontentious Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters blocked a road
OL,7,Fin Portadown, County Armagh on Sunday,
OL,8,Fpreventing a contentious Orange Order
OL,9,Fmarch from taking place.
OL,11,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,12,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,13,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,14,Fwas due to go ahead for the first time
OL,15,Fin 30 years following a series of late
OL,16,Flegal challenges.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
