OL,3,AEmbattled Serbian president resigns,
OL,4,Apaving way for early elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerbia's president has resigned after
OL,7,Fmore than a year of student-led
OL,8,Fprotests and growing public discontent
OL,9,Fover allegations of government
OL,10,Fcorruption.
OL,12,FAleksandar VuDMiDG said his
OL,13,Fadministration had preserved peace and
OL,14,Fstability during his nine-year tenure
OL,15,Fas he addressed supporters outside the
OL,16,Fpresidential building in the capital,
OL,17,FBelgrade.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
